  _route: 4
  _title: Meta Progression
  _subtitle: Persistent unlock overview
  _summary: Review long-term unlock tracks, Meta Currency goals and broadening options for Cards, Weapons, Towers and future Start Loadouts.
  _detailLines:
  - Persistent progress remains separated from the current Run state.
  - Unlocks widen choice space instead of replacing Run decisions.
  - Cards, Weapons and Towers can be admitted through controlled unlock paths.
  - Controller-first navigation remains the target interaction model for the full feature.
  _footerHint: Confirm or Cancel returns to the Main Menu.